# bluez/bluez-utils provide bluetooth.service and cups provides cups.service
# -- both are already referenced by customize_airootfs.sh and Calamares'
# services-systemd.conf, but neither package was actually in this list, so
# those enable calls were silently no-ops (masked by `|| true` / the
# services-systemd module's `mandatory: false`): Bluetooth and printing were
# dead on arrival on both the live session and any install.
bluez
